# Captures of the official Europass portal.  A .har contains session cookies,
# auth tokens and whatever was typed into the form; the XML extracted from a
# downloaded CV contains real personal data.  None of it is ever committable.
# A deliberately sanitised sample needs `git add -f`.
*.har
research/*.xml
